# Design system reference

Before writing or changing UI:

1. Read project root `DESIGN.md` (installed from https://getdesign.md/vercel/design-md).
2. Prefer CSS variables under `html.light` in `src/app/globals.css` (`--ds-ink`, `--ds-canvas`, `--ds-hairline`, `--ds-link`, etc.).
3. Light mode principles:
   - Page body: `#fafafa` (`--ds-canvas-soft`)
   - Cards: `#ffffff` + hairline `#ebebeb` + stacked soft shadow (not heavy drop shadows)
   - Ink text: `#171717` (not pure black for body chrome)
   - Secondary text: `#4d4d4d` · mute: `#888888`
   - Primary CTA: ink `#171717` on white; secondary is white + hairline
   - Links: `#0070f3`
   - Font: Geist Sans / Geist Mono (loaded in `layout.tsx`)
   - No indigo/sky wash on nav or chrome — monochrome + optional soft mesh ambient only
4. Domain status (product exception): free emerald / premium amber / taken rose — keep for scanability.
5. Dark mode: do not regress; only enhance light unless asked.
